# Auth & RBAC

Roles: `admin` | `manager` | `team_member`. Gate routes **and** nav/actions in UI.

## Admin

- Users: list, create, edit, toggle status (any role)
- Teams: list, create, manage members (any team)
- Tasks: create/edit/delete all; assign to any user; view all team tasks
- Analytics + export (any team)

## Manager

- Users: list/create/edit **team_member only**; toggle status for team members
- Teams: list/create; manage members on **their teams**
- Tasks: create/edit/delete in **their teams**; assign to team members
- Analytics + export for **their teams only**
- Cannot assign admin/manager role

## Team member

- View **assigned** tasks only; edit/complete **own** tasks
- **Cannot** create tasks, delete tasks, assign tasks, view analytics, manage users/teams
- Dashboard shows own tasks overview

## Implementation

```tsx
// ✅ Gate nav and buttons
{user.role === 'admin' && <Link to="/users">Users</Link>}
{canManageUsers(user) && <TeamsNav />}

// ❌ Relying only on hiding UI — API still enforces; always handle 403 toasts
```

Store JWT in memory + `localStorage`; redirect to `/login` on 401.
